          "pos": "n.",
          "meaning": "a drawing that shows places and roads"
        }
      ],
      "en": "No, it is on your right side. The map shows it."
    },
    {
      "id": "t6",
      "speaker": "You",
      "role": "you",
      "text": "Thank you very much for your help!",
